ສິ່ງນັ້ນຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ເປັນເວລາຫຼາຍປີແລ້ວ.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:22,500
[LEONARD]
I think you're wrong. These tracks aren't	* more than a few days old.
